    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:0",
      "text": "Customers keep saying our invoices look like a receipt from 2005."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:1",
      "text": "Fair. The template hasn't changed since we launched."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-partial-invoice-redesign:seg:2",
      "text": "The new design is approved. Logo, line items grouped by project, a clear due date."
    },
    {
